+- BLOCKER: task acceptance explicitly permits a precise preflight failure, but the stored generic checklist still requires tests, coverage, and lint, and `task-board handoff` requires every item checked. Evidence rules forbid checking those items without exact exit-0 commands. Resolution requires either an operator-installed/approved Go 1.25 root for replay or a board-owner checklist reconciliation that preserves the source-only/non-gating limitation.
